# promise: #822
# Arc's other menus follow the Mac's appearance as its + menu does: the capture menu (Send To…, Copy, Save…, ARC_Capture.bundle
# has a light value for each colour: white fill, black text) and the ArcMenu that Back's history and the sidebar's ••• open
# (the space's light palette, black titles). Reported after the + menu fix: the capture menu still opened dark in Light mode.
# View ▸ Appearance stands in for the Mac's setting here.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=1
wait 2
cra://action/appearanceLight
wait 1
cra://debug?arcMenus=light
expect-log arc menus light: capture=#FFFFFF captureInk=#000000 history=#F[0-9A-F]{5} historyInk=#000000 more=#F[0-9A-F]{5} moreInk=#000000 dark=0
cra://action/appearanceDark
wait 1
cra://debug?arcMenus=dark
expect-log arc menus dark: capture=#120F2E captureInk=#FFFFFF history=#[0-2][0-9A-F]{5} historyInk=#FFFFFF more=#[0-2][0-9A-F]{5} moreInk=#FFFFFF dark=1
cra://action/appearanceAutomatic
